		"description": "<p><strong>Soul Rite — Ruin (Lightning).</strong> 1 Action, Reach: 8. Remove Soul Touched from the target: it takes Lightning damage equal to your soul power. Ignores armor. If Soul Touched wasn’t removed, this does nothing. (Soul of Rage lets your Ruin deal Cold or Fire/Lightning damage.)</p><hr><p><em>[A] Using this Rite checks the target for your Soul Touched and removes it (the module warns but lets you proceed if the target isn’t marked).</em></p><p><em>[A] Rolls your soul power as Lightning damage that ignores armor and cannot miss or crit.</em></p><p><em>[M] Raging Ruin (L11): also apply the damage to every enemy adjacent to the target.</em></p>",
